+## Usage reported to afterModelResponse
+
+`afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits and receives `totalUsage?: TurnTotalUsage`, the summed provider-call usage for the entire turn rather than only the final round ([validated by: delivers TurnTotalUsage on afterModelResponse summing all reporting rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L621)).
+
+- A turn that executes multiple tool rounds reports the field-by-field sum of `inputTokens`, `outputTokens`, and `totalTokens` across every provider call in that turn, so existing consumers recording billing or audit entries now observe the full turn cost rather than under-counting tool rounds ([validated by: reports the summed usage from every provider call in a turn with two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestratorUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L44)).
